{
  "info": {
    "name": "Stock API",
    "description": "Collection complète pour l'API REST de gestion de stock (stock centralisé — module entrepôts supprimé, migration V13).\n\n## Utilisation\n1. Importez cette collection dans Postman\n2. Importez l'environnement stock-api-env.json\n3. Sélectionnez l'environnement \"Stock API - Dev\"\n4. Exécutez Connexion — comptes de démo : superadmin@stock.com/superadmin, admin@stock.com/admin, manager@stock.com/manager, gestionnaire@stock.com/gestionnaire, vendeur@stock.com/vendeur (l'inscription de démonstration n'existe plus)\n5. Le token est automatiquement sauvegardé dans la variable d'environnement `token`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentification",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Rafraîchir le token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"<<refresh-token>>\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Connexion",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    var data = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', data.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token sauvegardé: ' + data.token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@stock-api.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
